  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The phasing out of tiger farms in Lao PDR to disrupt and prevent the domestic and international trade in tiger parts and dirivatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support the Government in developing a plan to phase out tiger farming in Lao PDR. Under this primary objective, grantee along with Lao government officials will, (1) Conduct a full site audit at each facility to record, identify and register animals, and, (2) Develop a phase-plan that proposes placement and management solutions for all tigers at an individual level and that costs out the different placement options.</narrative>
  </description>
